OL,3,AColdest spell of autumn continues with
OL,4,Arisk of hill snow, ice and heavy rain
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the coldest spell of the autumn so
OL,7,Ffar continues, parts of the UK could
OL,8,Fsee some hill snow, ice or heavy rain
OL,9,Fthis week.
OL,11,FWith Arctic air to the north and east
OL,12,Fof the UK, Scotland, northern and
OL,13,Feastern England will experience
OL,14,Ftemperatures below the average with
OL,15,Fsome hill snow, freezing rain and ice.
OL,17,FMeanwhile, milder air to the west of
OL,18,Fthe UK will bring heavy rain to parts
OL,19,Fof Northern Ireland, Wales and
OL,20,Fsouth-west England with temperatures
OL,21,Faround average.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
